{"id":"selle","lemma":"selle","pos":"noun","rank":3676,"glosses":["saddle (for riding)","commode (chair containing a chamber pot)","excrement (human or animal)"],"ipa":"/sɛl/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/54/Fr-selle.ogg/Fr-selle.ogg.mp3","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"selles"},"formAudio":{"selles":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/5/56/LL-Q150_%28fra%29-J%C3%A9r%C3%A9my-G%C3%BCnther-Heinz_J%C3%A4hnick-Selles.wav"},"examples":[{"text":"Ne mets pas la selle sur le mauvais cheval.","en":"Don't put the saddle on the wrong horse.","words":[{"g":"not"},{"g":"to put","l":"mettre"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"bad"},{"g":"horse"}]},{"text":"On ne peut poser deux selles sur le même cheval.","en":"You can't put two saddles on the same horse.","words":[{"g":"we / one"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"can, to be able to","l":"pouvoir"},{"g":"to stop carrying"},{"g":"two"},null,{"g":"on"},{"g":"the / it"},{"g":"same"},{"g":"horse"}]},{"text":"En selle.","en":"Get on your horse.","words":[{"g":"in / of it"},null]},{"text":"Si la selle est trop lourde, la mule ne bougera pas.","en":"If the saddle is too heavy, the mule won't move.","words":[{"g":"if, whether"},{"g":"the / her"},null,{"g":"is","l":"être"},{"g":"too"},{"g":"door"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"mule"},{"g":"not"},{"g":"to move","l":"bouger"},{"g":"not"}]}]}